==Description==
'''Seal Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in [[The Final Act Event#The Final Act Battle Pass|The Final Act Battle Pass]] as a reward for reaching Level 5 on the premium track. It had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|105}} or {{Robux|135}} ({{Robux|108}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale) to unlock, with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|295}} or {{Robux|275}} ({{Robux|218}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

==Appearance==
'''Seal Charm''' showcases a seal laying down on a stage with two lights. It plays the default charm placement sound.

The color of the '''Seal Charm''' depends on the color of the player's name in chat, but it is red in its preview in the inventory. 

